# M3uListerr dashboard runtime state - MUST NOT be committed. Holds the SQLite
# database, event logs with viewer IPs/user-agents (PII), login sessions, and
# the per-install secret. m3ulisterr_data/ is created at runtime next to the
# app; the vendored chart libraries in m3ulisterr_assets/ ARE tracked (they are
# shipped code, not runtime state).
m3ulisterr_data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
config.php.m3utmp
